  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon Recovery Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Lebanon Recovery Fund is a flexible pooled funding mechanism for channeling international assistance to the Government of Lebanon in support of national recovery and reconstruction efforts. Since 2017, the Recovery Fund has shifted its focus to support the implementation 2030 Agenda through joint programme initiatives that fall under the United Nations Strategic Framework for 2017-2020.</narrative>
  </description>
